# Transient per-machine session state, rewritten rather than appended to. It
# describes one machine's client, one set of in-flight runs and one operator's
# next steps, so tracking it means every machine fighting over the same file.
# Durable facts belong in CLAUDE.md; measurements belong in tools/*/FINDINGS.md.
HANDOFF.md
